    "headline": "Multimodal AI beyond the limits of real-world data",
    "subheadline": "I build human-centered AI systems that combine vision, wearable sensing, time-series modeling, and generative methods, with a focus on scarce-data healthcare problems and efficient real-world deployment.",
    "bio": "I am an Artificial Intelligence researcher specializing in Computer Vision, Generative AI, and Time Series Analysis. My work connects multimodal learning, synthetic data, wearable sensing, and efficient modeling to practical healthcare challenges such as fall detection, mobility analysis, cognitive frailty, and clinical summarization.",
    "impact": "My research translates high-dimensional and multimodal data into scalable AI systems. I develop methods that learn from limited observations, responsibly extend data through generative models, and transfer richer multimodal knowledge into models that can operate on practical devices.",
